### Files Modified
- `src/air.zig` (+45 lines) - AIR type definitions
- `src/sema.zig` (+65 lines) - Semantic analysis

### Implementation Details

**AIR Type Definitions**:
```zig
// New pattern type in AIR
pattern: struct {
    pattern_type: PatternType,
    variants: []PatternVariant,
}

// AIR instructions
switch_expr: struct {
    expr: Ref,
    cases: []Ref,
    case_patterns: []Type,
}

case_pattern: struct {
    pattern: Ref,
    value: Ref,
    pattern_ty: Type,
}

// Pattern metadata
PatternType: enum {
    literal, tuple, struct, type_pat,
    union_variant, wildcard, variable
}

PatternVariant: struct {
    name: []const u8,
    field_types: []Type,
}
```

**Sema Functions Implemented**:
- `checkSwitchExpr()` - Validate switch expression type
- `checkPatternExhaustiveness()` - Exhaustiveness checking
- `checkPatternMatch()` - Pattern type matching validation
- `checkPatternBindings()` - Bind variables in pattern scope
- `getTypeName()` - Type name resolution helper

**Type Validation Rules**:
- Pattern types must match switch expression type
- All cases must be exhaustive (either explicit or wildcard)
- Variable bindings scoped to case body
- Wildcard cannot appear before exhaustive patterns
- Nested pattern types must be consistent

